{"3586450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World Tree Ranch: Elven Legacy", "steam_appid": 3586450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/extras/82a17a3d9e31ac214ef1c2abf5b700de.avif?t=1785816797\" width=780 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memories in a tranquil elven village devoted to worshipping the World Tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the elves living here are girls, and they have a unique request—they ask for your help in having children...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace a leisurely slow life filled with relaxation, and enjoy your days freely bonding with the charming and distinctive elven girls!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/extras/9e3b1d78ee22bec36738794eba60be52.avif?t=1785816797\" width=780 height=81 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Slow-Life Activities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in farming: grow a variety of crops and care for livestock to fully experience ranch life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience seasonal changes in the village: enjoy gathering items, bug-catching, and fishing, along with special seasonal events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop and expand the village as you progress, unlocking new features and expanding your home.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Relationships</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with the elven girls, gift them items, and strengthen your bonds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your connections and unlock marriage possibilities—aim to build your dream harem by marrying every girl!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress-Up and Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the girls' outfits at any time, customizing colors to your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide range of outfits, including everyday wear, uniforms, and fun cosplay costumes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra Content and Mini-Games</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in exciting horse races with horses you've personally raised. Train your horse to become a champion in prestigious G1 races!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on diverse challenges to earn trophies, and proudly display your achievements in your trophy room.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this delightful world of relaxation, romance, and endless possibilities!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/extras/82a17a3d9e31ac214ef1c2abf5b700de.avif?t=1785816797\" width=780 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memories in a tranquil elven village devoted to worshipping the World Tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the elves living here are girls, and they have a unique request—they ask for your help in having children...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace a leisurely slow life filled with relaxation, and enjoy your days freely bonding with the charming and distinctive elven girls!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/extras/9e3b1d78ee22bec36738794eba60be52.avif?t=1785816797\" width=780 height=81 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Slow-Life Activities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in farming: grow a variety of crops and care for livestock to fully experience ranch life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience seasonal changes in the village: enjoy gathering items, bug-catching, and fishing, along with special seasonal events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop and expand the village as you progress, unlocking new features and expanding your home.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Relationships</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with the elven girls, gift them items, and strengthen your bonds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your connections and unlock marriage possibilities—aim to build your dream harem by marrying every girl!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress-Up and Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the girls' outfits at any time, customizing colors to your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide range of outfits, including everyday wear, uniforms, and fun cosplay costumes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra Content and Mini-Games</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in exciting horse races with horses you've personally raised. Train your horse to become a champion in prestigious G1 races!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on diverse challenges to earn trophies, and proudly display your achievements in your trophy room.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this delightful world of relaxation, romance, and endless possibilities!</p>", "short_description": "You awaken with no memories in a tranquil elven village devoted to worshipping the World Tree. All the elves living here are girls, and they have a unique request—they ask for your help in having children...", "supported_languages": "Japanese, English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/2c3049f0b41fc80976f4b0278043